🇺🇸🇪🇺 US Dupes Public Into Accepting "Lesser" Basing Access to Greenland

▪️Using the elementary psychological tactic of threatening maximum options only to "retreat" to the actual objective, the US used the nonexistent threat of "annexation" of Greenland to coerce the public into accepting "lesser" US basing access;

▪️The US is likewise using the threats of "invasion" or "trade war" to dupe public opinion across the West to accept either "lesser" consessions to the US, or to help US client regimes justify "extreme measures" to counter the US which suspiciously appear to follow US dictates and desires (like doubling down on Ukraine because the US "abandoned" Europe);

▪️Political activity in the West when viewed as manipulative theater makes the outcomes obvious because real objectives are spelled out in policy papers and simply require the appropriate narratives to force public compliance;
